{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32922","headline":"秋晚寄题陆勳校书义兴禅居时淮南从事 · 李郢","name":"秋晚寄题陆勳校书义兴禅居时淮南从事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禅居秋草晚，萧索异前时。\n莲幕青云贵，翱翔绝後期。\n藓房柽架掩，山砌石盆欹。\n劒戟晨趋静，笙歌夜散迟。\n谷寒霜狖静，林晚磬虫悲。\n惠远烟霞在，方平杖履随。\n骨清须贵达，神重有威仪。\n万卒千蹄马，横鞭从信骑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32922.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32922","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}